sequenceDiagram
  actor N as Inspector
  participant C as InspectionController
  participant SR as ShippingRecord
  participant I as Inspection
  N->>C: 1 asks for the books awaiting inspection
  C->>SR: 2 asks for the records awaiting inspection
  C-->>N: 3 shows each book with weight, dimensions and packaging type
  N->>C: 4 selects a book
  C->>I: 5 asks for the book's open inspection
  N->>C: 6 records Pass
  C->>I: 7 records the result, inspector and time
  C->>SR: 8 sets the record to ready to ship
  C-->>N: 9 confirms the result and shows the updated list
